<item><title>Tanzania and Cuba advance university research cooperation</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/tanzania-and-cuba-advance-university-research-cooperation-0df2bc/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tz/tanzania-and-cuba-advance-university-research-cooperation-0df2bc/</guid><category>Tanzania</category><description>Universities in both countries are implementing collaboration under agreements that include a 2023 framework between Dar es Salaam and Havana.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 08:17:23 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tz.jpg" length="33199" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
